[Quotes]
;Gill winquotes
victory1 = "Immortality is not a gift. It is a responsibility."
victory2 = "It is natural for you to desire that which you can never have or achieve!"
victory3 = "Two centuries... A mere blink upon the face of eternity..."
victory4 = "You will have to exceed your limitations if you wish to survive."
victory5 = "Ignorant of your own incompetence... What a fool."
victory6 = "With your ignorance, you only see destruction. It is in fact, a prelude to rebirth!"
victory7 = "If you trained harder, maybe you wouldn't fall so quickly. Pathetic!"
victory8 = "You call yourself well-trained? Obviously humans follow the wrong leaders... anyone but me!"
victory9 = "So weak! Are you trying to dull my fighting senses?!"
victory10 = "Look into my eyes! I'll carve the mark of defeat on your brow."
victory11 = "You did well, for one of the sheep. Challenge me again when you learn from your mistakes."
victory12 = "The stage has been set. Do not interfere with my grand performance!"
victory13 = "Are you paralyzed yet? You're way below my expectations, but that's nothing new."
victory14 = "I admire your courage, but you'd be a fool to stand against me again."
victory15 = "A super being's influences is the key to his powers."
victory16 = "My methods may seem harsh in contrast to my true intentions."
victory17 = "Rest for now, then perform the great work is ahead of you!"
victory18 = "I held back, and still you cower on the ground like a peon. What a waste of human life!"
victory19 = "I should have been conquering the world, not wasting my time with the likes of you."
victory20 = "Not bad, but still you fall short of the perfection I embody."
victory21 = "You actually made me pay attention to this fight, for a moment."
victory22 = "I understand your jealousy. There is a huge gap between humans and a god."
victory23 = "You were only slightly easier to defeat than the one who came before me."
victory24 = "You cannot defeat me because you cannot deny me."
victory25 = "For thou art dust and dust I shalt pound thy into!"
victory26 = "Now! What is the one thing you've learned from your humiliation! \nTell me now!"
victory27 = "Defeating me would mean leading the world to destruction. \nAccept your divine punishment!"
victory28 = "I will never show mercy towards an idiot such as yourself..."
victory29 = "I respect you, passionate human warrior, but my respect will not save you!"
victory30 = "Martial arts exist solely to assert one's dominance over another."
victory31 = "You have proven to be an incompetent being, return to nothingness!"

